      "message": "20ms is generous.  integration time  is a variable,  in https://www.silabs.com/Support%20Documents/TechnicalDocs/AN498.pdf, chapter 6:\n\nt(DVIS) \u003d  4 µs + 2 * ( 25.6 µs  + t(VISREC) \u003c\u003c ALS_VIS_ADC_GAIN\n\nt(VISREC) \u003d 50ns \u003c\u003c VIS_ADC_REC\n\nALS_VIS_ADC_GAIN and VIS_ADC_REC are one\u0027s compliment \nso ~ 4us + 2 * (25.6us +  50ns \u003c\u003c 7) \u003d\u003d 68us\n\nSo 100us should be enough.",
